{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_route_dsl", "label": "Route-DSL (path / get / post / concat)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Baut einen In-Memory-Routenbaum, der beim Bind zu einer flachen Liste kompiliert und beim gewaehlten Backend registriert wird - identisch fuer alle drei Backends."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpextension", "label": "HttpExtension / HttpExtensionId", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "HTTP ist als Extension gebaut und bewusst getrennt von den I/O-Broker-Actors - HTTP-Server passen nicht in die Form 'eine Verbindung, viele Nachrichten'."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpserverbackend", "label": "HttpServerBackend (Interface)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Alle drei Backends implementieren es; das Backend besitzt nur die Listen-/Dispatch-Schleife."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_fastifybackend", "label": "FastifyBackend (Default)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_expressbackend", "label": "ExpressBackend", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_honobackend", "label": "HonoBackend", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Schlank und edge-tauglich; die Bun- und Deno-nativeste Option."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpclient", "label": "HttpClient (singleRequest)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Umschliesst das native fetch der Runtime; ein direkt gebautes new HttpClient() hat kein System und behaelt die eingebauten Zahlen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_client_limits", "label": "Client-Schranken (30 s, 8 MiB, 5 Hops)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Eine Antwort wird gepuffert, bevor der Aufrufer sie sieht - deshalb sind die drei Dinge, die die Gegenstelle kontrolliert, per Default begrenzt; abgebrochen wird, WAEHREND der Body eintrifft. Jede Schranke wird ueber einen Vergleich durchgesetzt und ein NaN verliert jeden Vergleich lautlos, deshalb wirft ein Wert ausserhalb des Bereichs OptionsError, bevor ein Socket geoeffnet wird."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_redirect_policy", "label": "Redirect-Policy (follow / error / manual)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Client folgt selbst, damit die Entscheidungen ZWISCHEN den Hops fallen: Origin-Wechsel verliert authorization/cookie/proxy-authorization, 303 (und 301/302 nach POST) laeuft als GET ohne Body weiter, Nicht-http(s)-Ziele werden abgelehnt, Deadline und Byte-Cap gelten kumulativ. Abgelehnt wird, bevor der Hop abgesetzt wird - eine Pruefung danach hat den Request bereits gestellt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpresponsetoolargeerror", "label": "HttpResponseTooLargeError", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_middleware_stack", "label": "HTTP-Middleware (cached / rateLimit / idempotent)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jede ist ein Handler-Wrapper: mit Optionen aufrufen, der zurueckgegebenen Funktion den Handler uebergeben, durch Verschachteln kombinieren."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_separate_cache_per_middleware", "label": "Jede Middleware bekommt ihren eigenen Cache", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "InMemoryCache ist LRU-begrenzt (Default 10 000); die Eviction leert zuerst Eintraege ohne Garantie, ordnet Garantien aber nicht gegeneinander - wer den Idempotency-Key variiert, evictet Zaehler und Records weiterhin. Getrennte Instanzen (oder ext.cache('rate-limit')) halten die Key-Flut der einen aus dem State der anderen heraus."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_thin_adapter", "label": "HTTP-Handler als duenner Adapter zu Actors", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Request parsen, einen Actor fragen, die Antwort marshallen. Kein geteilter veraenderlicher State in Handlern (sie laufen parallel), und schwere Arbeit in einen Actor auslagern - ein langsamer Handler belegt eine Verbindungslebenszeit."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_route_dsl", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpextension", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_fastifybackend", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpserverbackend", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_expressbackend", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpserverbackend", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_honobackend", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpserverbackend", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpclient", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_client_limits", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_client_limits", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_overview_httpresponsetoolargeerror", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {